		<p>The luggage compartment light illuminates when you open the tailgate.</p>
		<note type="caution" id="e01962">
			<p>The luggage compartment light comes on for approximately 25 minutes when the tailgate is open.</p>
			<p>To prevent unnecessary charging system drain, close the tailgate securely after using the compartment.</p>
		</note>
